---
description: iPhone app project, build, and release rules
globs: ios/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- `ios/project.yml` is the source of truth. After editing it, run `xcodegen generate --spec ios/project.yml` from the repo root; don't hand-edit `PrayDaily.xcodeproj`.
- The iOS target compiles `../Sources/Hilal` except `Hilal.swift` (macOS UI) and bundles `methods.json` and `../Resources/Sounds` as resources. iOS-only views live in `ios/PrayDaily/`.
- Bundle ID `com.reza.praydaily`, team `G56KC8CS7Z`, automatic signing.
- Select Xcode per command with `DEVELOPER_DIR`; never change the global `xcode-select`. The TestFlight-accepted Xcode 27.1 is at `.build/toolchains/xcode-27.1/Xcode.app`.
- Bump `CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION` in `project.yml` before each new TestFlight upload. Archive/upload steps are in `ios/README.md`.
- Use the asset catalog colors (Ink, Sage, Paper, Panel) rather than hard-coded colors.
